<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices -March 14.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices -March 14.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    91/95     97/101     UNQ     201/210</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   91/96     99/102   198/203   210/215</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker prices on Friday were quoted lower on very thin demand, traders said. &quot;We tried lowering our offers to meet shipowners bids, but their number were too low and we cannot afford to cut offers any further as cargo levels remained firm,&quot; said one seller.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
